{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 2"},"body":"Claim strength and source representations distinguished explicitly.\n\nInspected: Inspected entire configured endpoint, computedFullLaw, integerBinaryAnswerRawBand, integerBinaryWorkRawBand and explicit footprint branches; did not treat auxiliary code volume as verified runtime accounting.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:f4423e5449c144aa94560e05a2be9133087a7b2243dd86a72fa4387726cbf5fc","fingerprint":"sha256:50a54140432ff66da6a2e215f8b4898a726c53d01d47ad26e2e763e8fa11264f","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. Claim strength and source representations distinguished explicitly.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:1610096336cbaf94eebd8c6a9db75f209e42e441ca0eb14744b95b61d02aff2a","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.EditApproximation.almostLinearEditDistanceRawBand"],"explanation":"The configured assertion gives probability at least two thirds for a nonnegative integer answer within the one-sided factor 1+ε, and exact zero on identical integer strings. It also bounds the expectation of the named work function by (N+2)^(1+η) eventually for every η>0 and polynomially bounded integer symbols, matching the mathematical approximation and almost-linear cost components of the headline.","fingerprint":"sha256:5b72561625801c4ca321c5166910f90816b514e786bace3f8ed842809ab42200","limitations":"This s